      "title": "Troubleshooting Payment Discrepancies and Billing Errors in Payment Gateway v2",
      "content_summary": "This guide addresses common billing issues such as duplicate charges, incorrect invoices, and refund delays within the Payment Gateway v2 environment, outlining standard diagnostic steps and resolution paths.",
      "content_body": "When users report duplicate charges or incorrect invoices, first verify the transaction logs in the Payment Gateway v2 dashboard to confirm if the error is systemic or isolated. Common root causes include third-party service failures during currency conversion or operator errors in manual refund processing. If a subscription fails to renew or an undercharge is detected, check the billing configuration settings for alignment with the active plan. For persistent discrepancies, escalate to engineering to determine if a product patch is required or if vendor engagement is necessary to resolve external gateway latency. Always provide customer education on expected processing times for refunds to mitigate perceived service failures."
